# SW_FAST_FACATMS_2F — bereits integriert (phi/sources.φ Z. 822, IRC+FAC electric).
# Kein neuer Draft. HAPI-info: IRC/FAC/IRC_Error/FAC_Error (uA/m2), Latitude/Longitude/Radius vorhanden.

accepted https://vires.services/hapi/data?id=SW_EXPT_EFIA_TCT02&start={hour_ago}&stop={now}&parameters=Ehx,Ehy,Ehz&format=json
# title: Swarm EFI TCT02 (Thermal Ion Imager, 2 Hz) — E-Feld x/y/z (mV/m), electric; experimental, Abdeckung 2013-12-12 bis 2025-12-04
url https://vires.services/hapi/data?id=SW_EXPT_EFIA_TCT02&start={hour_ago}&stop={now}&parameters=Ehx,Ehy,Ehz&format=json
ttl 3600
at earth
hapi Ehx=swarm_electric_field_x_mvm Ehy=swarm_electric_field_y_mvm Ehz=swarm_electric_field_z_mvm
field swarm_electric_field_x_mvm swarm_electric_field_x_mvm inverse-square electric mV/m 3600 0.0 0.0
field swarm_electric_field_y_mvm swarm_electric_field_y_mvm inverse-square electric mV/m 3600 0.0 0.0
field swarm_electric_field_z_mvm swarm_electric_field_z_mvm inverse-square electric mV/m 3600 0.0 0.0

accepted https://vires.services/hapi/data?id=SW_OPER_MAGA_LR_1B&start={hour_ago}&stop={now}&parameters=F&format=json
# title: Swarm A Magnetfeld 1 Hz — B-Feld-Intensität F (nT), em; operational, Abdeckung 2013-11-25 bis 2026-08-11
url https://vires.services/hapi/data?id=SW_OPER_MAGA_LR_1B&start={hour_ago}&stop={now}&parameters=F&format=json
ttl 3600
at earth
hapi F=swarm_magnetic_field_intensity_nt
field swarm_magnetic_field_intensity_nt swarm_magnetic_field_intensity_nt inverse-square em nT 3600 0.0 0.0

# SW_FAST_AOBAFAC_2F — decline. Auroral-Oval-Boundary: Boundary_Flag (1=equatorward,
# 2=poleward, kategorial) + Quality [Pa,Sigma] + Pair_Indicator. Kein kontinuierlicher
# Feldwert — abgeleitete Grenzkarte aus FAC. Force Gate: kein Sinnesorgan für einen
# Grenzflag. (Parameter: Latitude, Longitude, Radius, Latitude_QD, Longitude_QD, MLT_QD.)

